# Ignore roadmap files (local tracking only)
**/ROADMAP.md
ROADMAP.md

# PowerShell temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# VS Code settings (if you want to ignore them)
.vscode/

# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Folder config file
Desktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Backstop: this is the PowerShell/Docker/AWS scripts repo, not the blog.
